## OBLinux live session: passwordless sudo for the wheel group.
## This is meant for the live/rescue environment (liveuser) only. Calamares
## typically clones this live filesystem onto the target disk, so this file
## WILL be present on freshly installed systems too unless the Calamares
## config (added in a later increment) explicitly removes it as a post-
## install step. TODO when wiring up Calamares: strip this file (or replace
## it with a normal password-required rule) on the installed target.
%wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
